# GLOG: pp-idle-skip: 2 classes keep clean bits, 2 may skip
# GLOG: pp-idle-skip: SNode: {{[1-8]}} of 8 instances decide (1 source reads, 0 inputs, group 2;
# GLOG: pp-idle-skip: SLR groups: 1 clean-bit writes cross to another group, 0 input samples to their readers' groups
# ELOG: pp-idle-skip: Node: {{[1-8]}} of 8 instances decide (1 source reads, 1 inputs;
# EGLOG: pp-idle-skip: Node: {{[1-8]}} of 8 instances decide (1 source reads, 1 inputs, group 0;
# EGLOG: pp-idle-skip: SLR groups: 0 clean-bit writes cross to another group, 1 input samples to their readers' groups
# SKIPS: {{^[1-9][0-9][0-9]+$}}
# BAD: {{^}}MISMATCH
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
# CHECK-NOT: PROTOCOL
